## Red Flags to Watch For

⚠️ **Don't skip cross-firecell tests** - Notes 1b, 1c, 9, 10 MUST test with multiple firecells in allFirecells array

⚠️ **Don't test implementation details** - Test behavior (system in/out, compliance info), not internal logic

⚠️ **Don't use hardcoded system arrays** - Use getFireSafetySystems() to get base systems dynamically

⚠️ **Don't forget parseSystemCode** - Use it to check system types reliably (not string matching)

⚠️ **Don't test Note 4 again** - It already has 6 tests, skip it

⚠️ **Don't break existing tests** - Add tests at the END of file, don't modify existing Note 4 tests

⚠️ **Don't assume base systems** - Base systems vary by occupant load and escape height, always call getFireSafetySystems()

